SmartSessionERC7739::erc6492Envelope
└── given an envelope signed by the session key, wrapped in ERC-6492
    ├── when the envelope is unchanged
    │   └── it returns ERC1271_MAGIC_VALUE
    ├── when the factory and factory data are arbitrary
    │   └── it never reverts and returns ERC1271_MAGIC_VALUE
    ├── when one byte of the permission id or the ERC-7739 tail of the wrapped envelope is flipped
    │   └── it never reverts and returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
    └── when the wrapped envelope carries a struct the session key did not sign
        └── it returns INVALID_SIGNATURE
